WEBVTT

00:00.280 --> 00:03.920
We are extremely proud to honour

00:03.920 --> 00:05.700
Professor Achyuta Samanta,

00:06.120 --> 00:09.240
the great and legendary
educationist of our times.

00:09.930 --> 00:13.490
After losing his father
at a tender age of four years,

00:14.250 --> 00:17.810
he obtained his master's degree
in chemistry at the age of 22

00:17.810 --> 00:19.650
in the year 1987.
